Package: NTSminer
Title: Non-Targeted Screening and Dual-Network Propagation for ECs Discovery
Version: 0.1.41
Authors@R: person("Jardeko", email = "jardeko@gmail.com", role = c("cre"))
Description: An advanced computational framework for non-targeted screening (NTS) of complex environmental samples. NTSminer integrates mass spectrometry data processing, dual-network propagation (structural and spectral), and interactive graph visualizations to accelerate the discovery, tracing, and annotation of novel per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) and their transformation products.
